{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-7-1","title":"Jeremiah 7:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Jeremiah is sent to call to true repentance, to prevent the Jews' captivity. 8 He rejects their vain confidence, 12 by the example of Shiloh. 17 He threatens them for their idolatry. 21 He rejects the sacrifices of the disobedient. 29 He exhorts to mourn for their abominations in Tophet; 32 and the judgments for the same.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-2","title":"Jeremiah 7:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>A.M. 3394. B.C. 610. Stand. 17:19; 19:2,14; 22:1; 26:2; 36:6,10; Pr 1:20,21; 8:2,3; Joh 18:20 Ac 5:20,42 Hear. 2:4; 10:1; 19:3; 34:4; 44:24; 1Ki 22:19; Isa 1:10; Eze 2:4,5 Ho 5:1; Am 7:16; Mic 1:2; 3:1,9; Mt 13:9; Re 2:7,11,17,29; 3:6,13 Re 3: 22 that enter. 17:19,20; 22:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-3","title":"Jeremiah 7:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Amend. 5-7; 18:11; 26:13; 35:15; Pr 28:13; Isa 1:16-19; 55:7; Eze 18:30,31 Eze 33:4-11; Mt 3:8-10; Jas 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-4","title":"Jeremiah 7:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Trust. 8; 6:14; 28:15; 29:23,31; Eze 13:19; Mt 3:9,10 The temple. 9-12; 1Sa 4:3,4; Mic 3:11; Zep 3:11; Lu 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-5","title":"Jeremiah 7:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>For if. 3; 4:1,2; Isa 1:19 if ye throughly. Jud 5:1; 21:12; 1Ki 6:12,13; Isa 16:3; Eze 18:8,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-6","title":"Jeremiah 7:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>oppress. 22:3,4,15,16; Ex 22:21-24; De 24:17; 27:19; Job 31:13-22 Ps 82:3,4; Zec 7:9-12; Mal 3:5; Jas 1:27 and shed. 2:30,34; 22:17; 26:15,23; 2Ki 21:6; 24:4; Ps 106:38; Isa 59:7 La 4:13; Eze 22:3-6; Mt 23:35-37; 27:4,25 neither walk. 13:10; De 6:14,15; 8:19; 11:28; Eze 18:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-7","title":"Jeremiah 7:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>will I. 17:20-27; 18:7,8; 25:5 in the land. 3:18; De 4:40; 2Ch 33:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-8","title":"Jeremiah 7:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>ye trust. 4; 4:10; 5:31; 8:10; 14:13,14; 23:14-16,26,32; Isa 28:15; 30:10 Eze 13:6-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-9","title":"Jeremiah 7:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>steal. 9:2-9; Ps 50:16-21; Isa 59:1-8; Eze 18:10-13,18; 33:25,26 Ho 4:1-3; Mic 3:8-12; Zep 1:5; Zec 5:3,4; Mal 3:5; Ro 2:2,17-29 1Co 6:9,10; Ga 5:19-21; Eph 5:5-7; 2Ti 3:2-5; Jas 4:1-4; Re 21:8 Re 22:15 and burn. 11:13,17; 32:29; 1Ki 18:21 and walk. 6; 13:10; 44:3; Ex 20:3; De 32:17; Jud 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-10","title":"Jeremiah 7:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>come. Pr 7:14,15; 15:8; Isa 1:10-15; 48:2; 58:2-4; Eze 20:39; 23:29,37,39 Eze 33:31; Mt 23:14; Joh 13:18,26,27; 18:28 which is called, etc. Heb. whereupon my name is called. 11,14,30; 32:34; 34:15; 2Ki 21:4; 2Ch 33:4,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-11","title":"Jeremiah 7:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>this. 2Ch 6:33; Isa 56:7; Mt 21:13; Mr 11:17; Lu 19:45,46; Joh 2:16 even. 2:34; 16:16,17; 23:24; Heb 4:13; Re 2:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-12","title":"Jeremiah 7:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>my place. Jos 18:1; Jud 18:31; 1Sa 1:3 where. De 12:5,11 and see. 26:6; 1Sa 4:3,4,10,11,22-6:21; Ps 78:60-64</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-13","title":"Jeremiah 7:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>and I spake. 25; 11:7; 25:3; 35:15; 44:4; 2Ch 36:15,16; Ne 9:29,30 and I called. Pr 1:24; Isa 50:2; 65:12; 66:4; Ho 11:2,7; Zec 7:13; Mt 23:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-14","title":"Jeremiah 7:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>wherein. 4,10; De 28:52; Mic 3:11; Ac 6:13,14 as. 26:6-9,18; 52:13-23; 1Sa 4:10,11; 1Ki 9:7,8; 2Ki 25:9; 2Ch 7:21 2Ch 36:18,19; Ps 74:6-8; 78:60; Isa 64:11; La 2:7; 4:1; Eze 7:20-22 Eze 9:5-7; 24:21; Mic 3:12; Mt 24:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-15","title":"Jeremiah 7:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>I will. 3:8; 15:1; 23:39; 52:3; 2Ki 17:18-20,23; 24:20; Ho 1:4; 9:9,16,17 Ho 13:16 the whole. 2Ch 15:9; Ps 78:67,68; Ho 9:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-16","title":"Jeremiah 7:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>pray. 11:14; 14:11,12; 15:1; 18:20; Ex 32:10; Eze 14:14-20; 1Jo 5:16 I will. 2Sa 8:18; Isa 1:15; Mic 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-17","title":"Jeremiah 7:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>6:27; Eze 8:6-18; 14:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-18","title":"Jeremiah 7:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>children. 44:17-19,25; 1Co 10:22 queen of heaven. or, frame, or workmanship of heaven.Though several MSS. and editions have {melachath,} \"workmanship,\" instead of {melecheth,} \"queen\" yet the latter reading seems the true one, as the LXX. in the parallel place, and the Vulgate uniformly have \"the queen of heaven;\" by which there can be little doubt, is meant the Moon.</p>\n<p>De 4:19; Job 31:26-28 to pour. 19:13; 32:29; De 32:37,38; Ps 16:4; Isa 57:6; 65:11; Eze 20:28 that they. 25:7; Isa 3:8; 65:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-19","title":"Jeremiah 7:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>they provoke. 2:17,19; De 32:16,21,22; Isa 1:20,24; Eze 8:17,18; 1Co 10:22 the confusion. 20:11; Ezr 9:7; Isa 45:16; Da 9:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-20","title":"Jeremiah 7:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Behold. 4:23-26; 9:10,11; 12:4; 14:16; 42:18; 44:6; Isa 42:25; La 2:3-5 La 4:11; Eze 20:47,48; 22:22; Da 9:11; Na 1:6; Mal 4:1; Re 14:10 Re 16:1-21 and shall. 17:27; 2Ki 22:17; Isa 66:24; Mr 9:43-48</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-21","title":"Jeremiah 7:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Put. 6:20; Isa 1:11-15; Ho 8:13; Am 5:21-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-22","title":"Jeremiah 7:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>nor. 1Sa 15:22; Ps 40:6; 50:8-17; 51:16,17; Ho 6:6; Mt 9:13; Mr 12:33 burnt offerings. Heb. the matter of burnt offerings.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-23","title":"Jeremiah 7:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Obey. 11:4,7; Ex 15:26; 19:5,6; Le 26:3-12; De 5:29,33; 6:3; 11:27; 13:4 De 30:2,8,20; Ro 16:26; 2Co 10:5; Heb 5:9 and I. 31:33 that it. 42:6; De 4:10; 5:16,33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-24","title":"Jeremiah 7:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>they. 26; 11:7,8; Ex 32:7,8; Ne 9:16-20; Ps 81:11,12; 106:7-48 Eze 20:8,13,16,21 walked. 23:17; De 29:19 imagination. or, stubbornness. 3:17; *marg: went. Heb. were. backward. 26; 2:27; 8:5; 32:33; Ne 9:29; Ho 4:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-25","title":"Jeremiah 7:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>the day. 32:30,31; De 9:7,21-24; 1Sa 8:7,8; Ezr 9:7; Ne 9:16-18,26 Ps 106:13-22; Eze 2:3; 20:5-32; 23:2,3 sent. 13; 25:4; 2Ch 36:15; Ne 9:30; Mt 21:34-36; Lu 20:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-26","title":"Jeremiah 7:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>they hearkened. 24; 6:17; 11:8; 17:23; 25:3,7; 26:5; 29:19; 34:14; 44:16; 2Ch 33:10 Ne 9:16; Da 9:6 but. 19:15; 2Ki 17:14; 2Ch 30:8; Ne 9:17,29; Pr 29:1; Isa 48:4; Ac 7:51 Ro 2:5 they did. 16:12; Mt 21:38; 23:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-27","title":"Jeremiah 7:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>thou shalt speak. 1:7; 26:2; Eze 2:4-7; 3:17,18; Ac 20:27 hearken. 1:19; Isa 6:9,10; Eze 3:4-11 also. Isa 50:2; 65:12; Zec 7:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-28","title":"Jeremiah 7:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>nor. 2:30; 5:3; 6:29,30; Isa 1:4,5; Zep 3:2 correction. or, instruction. 6:8; 32:33; Ps 50:17; Pr 1:7; Zep 3:7 truth. 5:1; 9:3-8; Isa 59:14,15; Ho 4:1; Mic 7:2-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-29","title":"Jeremiah 7:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>Cut. 16:6; 47:5; 48:37; Job 1:20; Isa 15:2,3; Mic 1:16 and take. 9:17-21; Eze 19:1; 28:12 for. 6:30; 2Ki 17:20; Zec 11:8,9 generation. De 32:5; Mt 3:7; 12:39; 16:4; 23:36; Ac 2:40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-30","title":"Jeremiah 7:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>they. 23:11; 32:34; 2Ki 21:4,7; 23:4-6,12; 2Ch 33:4,5,7,15; Eze 7:20 Eze 8:5-17; 43:7,8; Da 9:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-31","title":"Jeremiah 7:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>the high. 19:5,6; 32:35; 2Ki 23:20; 2Ch 33:6 the valley. 19:2; Jos 15:8; 2Ch 28:3 to burn. De 12:31; 2Ki 17:17; Ps 106:37,38; Eze 16:20 which I. Le 18:21; 20:1-5; De 17:3 came it into. Heb. came it upon.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-32","title":"Jeremiah 7:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>the days. 19:6; Le 26:30; Eze 6:5-7 for. 19:11,13; 2Ki 23:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-33","title":"Jeremiah 7:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>8:1,2; 9:22; 12:9; 16:4; 22:19; 25:33; 34:20; De 28:26; Ps 79:2,3 Eze 39:4,18-20; Re 19:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-7-34","title":"Jeremiah 7:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>to cease. 16:9; 25:10; 33:10; Isa 24:7,8; Eze 26:13; Ho 2:11; Re 18:23 for. 4:27; Le 26:33; Isa 1:7; 3:26; 6:11; Mic 7:13</p>"}]}